  contract my assumption: a ticket that names no epic shows on the ticket board only and counts toward no epic's status
  contract my assumption: a ticket names the epics of the features its specs sit in, at any depth (the epics tagged on those features and on the features they are in, BEH-EPIC-2), so a ticket carries no epic line of its own; the ticket board lists the features and specs it touches

